  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for Capacity Building of the Vietnam Court Academy based on Digital Innovation Technology</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to strengthening the status of the Court Academy as a higher education institution in the judicial field and leading the advancement of justice in Vietnam&#xc0ac;&#xbc95;&#xbd84;&#xc57c; &#xace0;&#xb4f1;&#xad50;&#xc721;&#xc744; &#xc704;&#xd55c; &#xc778;&#xc801; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9;&#xac15;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 1: Strengthening human competence for higher education, Output 1.1: Systematization of education programs and strengthening of educational capabilities, Output 1.2: Expansion of research activities on judicial policy and legislation, Outcome 2: Building an education/research infrastructure based on the digitalization, Output 2.1: Construction of Smart Library, Output 2.2: Establishment of Research/education DB, Output 2.3: Establishment of E-learning system, Outcome 3: Building the foundation for fair and efficient academic administration management, Output 3.1: Strengthening academic administrative management capabilities, Output 3.2: Establishment of Academic administrative management system</narrative>
  </description>
